abstract: >-
  A reproducible statistical case study of aggregate hourly rentals, with
  chronological model selection, empirical forecast intervals and an explicit
  workload planning loss. Frozen final evaluation documents uncertainty
  undercoverage and limits on operational interpretation.
keywords:
  - time series
  - forecasting
  - calibration
  - decision analysis
